led hands impose stricter requirements. Pay attention to the marking for each pattern.</p></section><section><h2>Jokers are not universal wildcards</h2><p>Jokers are useful in eligible groups, but cannot substitute for every single or pair. Follow the official rules and the hand's requirements.</p></section><section><h2>Use the current official card</h2><p>Obtain the current card from the authorized issuer. We do not reproduce its copyrighted hand patterns or sell unofficial copies.</p></section><aside>Independent educational guide. We are not affiliated with the National Mah Jongg League or any Mahjong retailer. Check current official rules and product specifications.</aside><p><a href="/american-mahjong/">← Explore more American Mahjong guides</a></p></main><footer>© {new Date().getFullYear()} My Mahjong Era</footer></body></html>